{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「综合大家的情报来看的话、妈妈喵所在的地方……」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1624", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大概……在这附近吧，还挺高的」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1625", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪说的地方是位于结姬女子学院西北方向的丘陵地。", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那里人烟稀少，\\n土地开发也难以开展。", "text_idx": 178, "plain": "那里人烟稀少，土地开发也难以开展。", "plain_idx": 179, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "若是侧耳聆听，可以听到山间鸟儿们的欢唱。", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "会有一种自己就是自然的一部分的感觉。", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "很明显，那里对动物们来说是无可替代的重要地方。", "text_idx": 182, "plain": "很明显，那里对动物们来说是无可替代的重要地方。", "plain_idx": 182, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「离学校真远……」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4477", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "站在那里的崖边上，可以看到整个旧市区。", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也能看到远处的结女校园。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，这个情报准确吗？」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是当然。安洁在学校后院里看到妈妈喵之后可是一直跟在它后面」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": "「那是当然。安洁在学校后院里看到妈妈喵之后可是一直跟在它后面」", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3461", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我和樱乃是在迷路后偶然发现的」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4478", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「预料之内」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1340", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说起来那时候还是我去接的她们……", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是在家附近看到的，\\n　我想它大概是往这个方向逃跑了」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "「我是在家附近看到的，　我想它大概是往这个方向逃跑了」", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1626", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我们现在该怎么办？」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2166", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家的视线都往美羽学姐那里集中过去。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，当学姐点了点头准备说话的时候。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "母熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜……」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "？？？", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": "mp0000", "char_id": "母ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2167", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个奇妙的叫声，不会错了。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「刚、刚刚的是……」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4479", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘘，还是安静点比较好」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1627", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1341", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都屏住了呼吸，注意着周围。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不一会儿，我们就看到森林的深处有个小小的生物身影在动着。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "母熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜——」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mp0001", "char_id": "母ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "熊喵幼崽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜溜」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "kp0000", "char_id": "子ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……找到了」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4480", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没错了，是妈妈喵」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1628", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还有只小的」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1342", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "亲子的模样有些不一样。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真可爱……\\n　好想抱回到安洁的房间里呀～」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "「真可爱……　好想抱回到安洁的房间里呀～」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3462", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，我也觉得没错」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2168", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「几年前我和纱纱见到过小熊喵的妈妈，\\n　看起来一样……」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "「几年前我和纱纱见到过小熊喵的妈妈，　看起来一样……」", "plain_idx": 240, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2169", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来这下子是确定了。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵的母亲还活着，就在这里的森林里生活着。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后这里就是……熊喵该回去的地方。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总而言之，我们不要打扰它们，先回去吧」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说的也是。这里不是人类随便来的地方」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1629", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们，该什么时候带熊喵来？」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4481", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁觉得还是越早越好」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3463", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「社团长来决定」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1343", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2170", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐再次点了点头，看向我们。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天我们就带小熊喵来这里吧」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2171", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「让小熊喵回到妈妈的身边后……\\n　我希望大家能忘记这个地方」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": "「让小熊喵回到妈妈的身边后……　我希望大家能忘记这个地方」", "plain_idx": 259, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2172", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「希望大家不要再到这个地方来了」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2173", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实，希望这里是动物们能安心的地方……」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "「确实，希望这里是动物们能安心的地方……」", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4482", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1344", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁，舍不得和熊喵告别……」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "「安洁，舍不得和熊喵告别……」", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3464", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1630", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，小熊喵必须得回家」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1631", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们总会毕业，它不可能一直和我们在一起」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "「我们总会毕业，它不可能一直和我们在一起」", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1632", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是呢……」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4483", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
