{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在回活动室的路上，\\n我注意到纱凪从中途开始有些落后于队伍。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "在回活动室的路上，我注意到纱凪从中途开始有些落后于队伍。", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「走累了吗？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我能做的就到这里为止了」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1637", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你明白的吧。\\n　美羽学姐，她对小熊喵……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": "「你明白的吧。　美羽学姐，她对小熊喵……」", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1638", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪咬着自己的下唇，艰难地说着。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明在这之前，她都是对寻找熊喵母亲的事最上心的一个。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": "明明在这之前，她都是对寻找熊喵母亲的事最上心的一个。", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我在中途的时候才发现这不是她的本意。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": "但我在中途的时候才发现这不是她的本意。", "plain_idx": 301, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下来的事就该轮到你了」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1639", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我明白」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐虽然没有说出来，\\n但她肯定是不愿意和熊喵分开的。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "美羽学姐虽然没有说出来，但她肯定是不愿意和熊喵分开的。", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪为了不让这样的她亲自去找熊喵的母亲，\\n所以才一直努力着。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "纱凪为了不让这样的她亲自去找熊喵的母亲，所以才一直努力着。", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……人在放松下来后果然好累啊。\\n　现在让我自己呆一会吧」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "「唉……人在放松下来后果然好累啊。　现在让我自己呆一会吧」", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1640", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，让你勉强自己了」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1641", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
